    {
      "conditions": [],
      "definition": "Irreducible Architectural Carrier Set (IACS) is the smallest lawful top-level carrier family needed for a boundary's real functionality and authority flow. Subordinate Payload is internal payload detail, not top-level by default. Promotion Test is the explicit test for promoting it to a top-level type. Boundary Inflation is promotion of subordinate detail to extra peer types without irreducible need. Example IACS roles include source truth, admission, execution, yielded/recovery, effect plan and public projection carriers; these examples do not mandate a fixed inventory.",
