          "end_line": 48,
          "quote": "`a_c` makes no claim of universal applicability, logical completeness,\nconsistency, decidability, soundness, or category-theoretic status except where\nan exact, separately identified proof establishes that claim for a declared\nfragment, model, or relation.",
          "section_id": "repo://stdo-v3-generation-rc9/codex/5592168e26759f37e730aed12c030a6061709ec4/source/standards/AXIOMATIC_CALCULUS.md#The%20STDO%20Axiomatic%20Calculus%20for%20Governed%20Symbolic%20Systems%2FPosition",
