      "statement": "Definitions/laws own the specialization within the selected complete STDO cut and explicitly consume common result/composition owners. Interpretation needs no implicit STDO representation, GTL carrier or downstream implementation. This member introduces F_D, F_P and F_H as policy-selected generic kinds, not imported identities or a theorem forced by predecessor clauses; equal spelling in graph, runtime, ODD or application shorthand creates no identity, import or equivalence. Exact-basis issuance must resolve the relative provenance links into absolute predecessor-cut principle_refs within derivation release_uri. Derivation is one-way: models, carriers, proof tools and successful applications cannot amend source principles or calculus.",
