      "key": "native_constructability_requirement",
      "statement": "Semantic coherence cannot establish acceptability when selected substrate cannot natively realize required identities, relationships, transitions, authority, effects, lifecycle, composition, publication and retirement. Missing capability stays explicit gap or triggers lawful re-entry; bridges/adapters/filesystem runners/test doubles/future promises cannot conceal it. Consumer chooses substrate and evidence mechanism; no implementation is prescribed.",
      "uncertainty": ""
