      "conditions": ["Comparing material candidates admitted to the bounded population."],
      "exceptions": ["A dominated candidate can become selectable only when new evidence or another material dimension invalidates the dominance relation."],
      "grounding": [
        {
          "end_line": 707,
          "quote": "One lawful candidate composition **dominates** another on the current basis\nonly when every material decision dimension is comparable or evidenced as\nnon-discriminating between them, it is no worse on every comparable dimension,\nand it is strictly better on at least one. A material unknown that could reverse\nthe relation prevents dominance and remains a gap. A dominated candidate cannot\nbe selected unless new evidence or another material dimension invalidates the\ndominance relation. Therefore a local rebuild of generic mechanics is\ninadmissible when an existing lawful foundation composition dominates it.\nUnused feature breadth alone does not establish dominance and may itself add\nlifecycle cost.",
          "section_id": "repo://stdo-v3-generation-rc9/codex/5592168e26759f37e730aed12c030a6061709ec4/source/standards/DESIGN_MODULE_METHOD.md#Design%20Module%20Method%2F4B.%20Ontology-First%20Design%20Rule%2FCapability%20And%20Foundation%20Selection%20%28%60STDO-UP-023%60%29",
          "start_line": 698
        }
      ],
      "key": "foundation_comparison_and_selection",
      "statement": "Ledger/equivalent compares all decision-material dimensions, including functional/native fit; semantic/operation-authority leakage; adapter/integration/migration/deletion/future-code cost; license/maintenance/security/upgrade/supply chain; package/runtime/startup/storage/operation cost; determinism/concurrency/failure/recovery/reconstruction/replay; proof burden; exit/replacement/reversibility. Hard authority, Product-contract, safety, security, licensing or native-construction failure eliminates. Unknown stays unknown, never favorable score; universal scalar is unnecessary. Dominance requires every material dimension comparable or evidenced nondiscriminating, no worse on every comparable dimension, strictly better on at least one; potentially reversing unknown prevents it. Dominated local rebuilding is inadmissible subject to exception. Unused features alone do not dominate and may add cost. Existing tradeoff owner may choose lawful undominated composition only through exact Product/basis priorities and risk tolerance with recorded frontier resolution; unresolved priorities leave gap. No automatic minimum dependencies/edit/lines or maximum features. Rejected material candidates record decisive evidence/falsifier; unsupported preference is not closure. Reuse grants no automatic authority; assigned authority roles must preserve owner/kind/subject/scope/basis/lifecycle/refusal invariants, and capability/provenance/authorship cannot widen/remint roles. Ownership remains with relation, including reused implementations; local generic code must win same comparison and is not default.",
